{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_67_1","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_67","textTraditional":"漢外戚有新室之患，晉宗室有八王之難。遼史耶律、蕭氏十居八九，宗室、外戚，勢分力敵，相為唇齒，以翰邦家，是或一道。然以是而興，亦以是而亡，又其法之弊也。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_67_2","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_67","textTraditional":"契丹外戚，其先曰二審密氏：曰拔里，曰乙室已。至遼太祖，娶述律氏。述律，本回鶻糯思之後。大同元年，太宗自汴將還，留外戚小漢為汴州節度使，賜姓名曰蕭翰，以從中國之俗，由是拔里、乙室已、述律三族皆為蕭姓。拔里二房，曰大父、少父；乙室已亦二房，曰大翁、小翁；世宗以舅氏塔列葛為國舅別部。三族世預北宰相之選，自太祖神冊二年命阿骨只始也。聖宗合拔里、乙室已二國舅帳為一，與別部為二。此遼外戚之始末也。作外戚表。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_67_3","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_67","textTraditional":"一世","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_67_4","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_67","textTraditional":"二世","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_67_5","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_67","textTraditional":"三世","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_67_6","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_67","textTraditional":"四世","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_67_7","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_67","textTraditional":"五世","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_67_8","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_67","textTraditional":"六世","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_67_9","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_67","textTraditional":"七世","sentenceOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_67_10","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_67","textTraditional":"八世","sentenceOrder":10},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_67_11","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_67","textTraditional":"九世","sentenceOrder":11},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_67_12","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_67","textTraditional":"十世","sentenceOrder":12},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_67_13","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_67","textTraditional":"十一世","sentenceOrder":13},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_67_14","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_67","textTraditional":"蕭氏：","sentenceOrder":14},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_67_15","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_67","textTraditional":"五世祖胡母里。","sentenceOrder":15},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_67_16","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_67","textTraditional":"北府宰相敵魯。","sentenceOrder":16},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_67_17","chapterId":"